# Skills Demonstrated

This lab demonstrates practical Azure infrastructure deployment skills including:

- Azure Bicep template authoring
- Infrastructure as Code (IaC)
- Azure CLI deployments
- Existing resource references
- Parent-child resource relationships
- Virtual networking
- NSG configuration
- VM deployment
- Boot diagnostics configuration
- VM Custom Script Extensions
- Linux App Service deployments
- Parameterized templates
- Outputs and resource references

---

# Notes

These templates are part of an Azure cloud engineering learning portfolio focused on hands-on deployment and infrastructure automation using Azure Bicep and Azure CLI.
